    "title": "About Effortless: The Team Making Growth more manageable for Ambitious SMBs",
    "description": "Founded by ex-Deloitte CAs. Effortless is built by Agrya FinLabs to simplify sales, expenses, and billing for India's fastest-growing SMBs.",
