    "missionHeading": ["Amazing People.", "Bold Mission.", "Lasting Impact."],
    "missionDescription": "We are a team of builders, problem-solvers, and change-makers who believe finance should be effortless, not exhausting. What brings us together is a shared obsession with simplifying business operations through innovation, automation, and design that just works. If you want to tackle real-world challenges, work with brilliant minds, and create lasting impact, this is where you belong."
